    'private_terms_20' => 'hide their game history on the site.',
    'private_terms_21' => 'We collect information from the player so that we can:',
    'private_terms_22' => 'identify you as a player for security and compliance with our legal obligations;',
    'private_terms_23' => 'maintain the player\'s account;',
    'private_terms_24' => 'verify the accuracy of the information provided by the player;',
    'private_terms_25' => 'Receive questions and comments from the player in order to respond to them and improve our services;',
    'private_terms_26' => 'Periodically send written notices about important service changes, technical updates, etc.;',
    'private_terms_27' => 'Investigate suspected illegal or fraudulent activity related to our services;',
    'private_terms_28' => 'Report to regulatory authorities the commission or suspicion of crimes, including money laundering or fraud;',
    'private_terms_29' => 'Increase the security and reliability of our services;',
    'private_terms_30' => 'Carry out other tasks necessary to fulfill contractual obligations to the player.',
    'private_terms_31' => 'Marketing',
    'private_terms_32_1' => 'From time to time, we may use your personal information to inform you about our products or services, or promotions that we believe may be of interest or benefit to you. We may do this by email, SMS, or phone. If you no longer wish to receive marketing or promotional materials at all, or in any particular form, you may contact us at any time by email',
    'private_terms_32_2' => 'with your request, which we will fulfill as soon as possible.',
    'private_terms_33' => 'Access to Personal Information',
    'private_terms_34' => 'You can access the personal information collected by clicking the "Settings" link on the website or by contacting us via email',
    'private_terms_35' => 'We will provide you with access to your personal information in the necessary manner, if possible, and within a reasonable time frame. If we deny access for such reasons, we will notify you in writing of the refusal, the reasons, and the complaint mechanisms available to you.',
    'private_terms_36' => 'Information Management',
    'private_terms_37' => 'We will take all reasonable steps to ensure the security of the personal information collected, used, or disclosed from the player.',
    'private_terms_38' => 'Only authorized persons may have access to such information.',
    'private_terms_39' => 'Will destroy the personal information we hold once it is no longer needed for use, storage, or disclosure, but not earlier than 5 years after its use.',
    'private_terms_40' => 'The management of this information must comply with applicable law.',
    'private_terms_41' => 'Security',
    'private_terms_42' => 'You guarantee that you take all possible measures to safeguard the information you provide to us.',
    'private_terms_43' => 'You are responsible for the security and access to your own computer, mobile device, or any other device used to access the site.',
    'private_terms_44' => 'You are fully responsible for keeping your username, password, and any other account information confidential.',
    'private_terms_45' => 'We will take all reasonable measures to protect your personal information from misuse, loss, and unauthorized access, alteration, and disclosure, including through password-protected systems, databases, and Secure Socket Layer (SSL) technology.',
    'private_terms_46_1' => 'Employees, agents, and contractors',
    'private_terms_46_2' => 'are required to maintain the confidentiality of players’ personal information.',
    'private_terms_47' => 'Changes to This Policy',
    'private_terms_48' => 'We change this Privacy Policy from time to time, but do not limit your rights described herein without your explicit consent. We always indicate the date of the last update and provide access to archived versions. If the changes are significant, we will make a more prominent notice (for example, for changes to the privacy policy of certain services, we notify by email).',
    'private_terms_49' => 'Handling Complaints and Applicable Law',
    'private_terms_50' => 'In the event of disputes or disagreements, our decision is final, and you fully agree with it. All disputes and disagreements arising from or in connection with this policy shall be resolved through negotiations. If an agreement cannot be reached through negotiations, disputes, disagreements, and claims arising from this policy shall be resolved in accordance with the laws of the Netherlands Antilles.',
